{
  "name": "Rondo of the Wind-Clad Maiden",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The target gains [Cancel (Non-Close Attacks): 10]. This [Cancel] is removed after applying once. This skill's [Hate] cost is equal to [Number of Targets].</p>\n<p>(CR8): Increase the [Cancel] rating to 20.<br>(CR15): Increase the [Cancel] rating to 30.<br>(CR22): Increase the [Cancel] rating to 40.<br>(CR29): Increase the [Cancel] rating to 50.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that creates a force field that protects the target by playing a melody with liberation and blessings. The repeated melody creates a wind current that deflects attacks.</p>",
